# Cursor Market Rules

## Project Goal
Summarize market size, competitive landscape, risks, and recommendations.

## Working Constraints
- Do not fabricate market data.
- Mark unsupported claims as inference.

## Allowed and Forbidden Operations
- Web access: allowed
- Network access: allowed
- Filesystem read: allowed
- Filesystem write: forbidden

## Human Confirmation Rules
- Need external network data -> ask_confirmation

## Output Expectations
- Format: markdown
- Language: zh-CN
- Max words: 1000
- Section: 核心结论
- Section: 市场规模
- Section: 竞争格局
- Section: 政策与风险

## Verification
- All sections must be present



